      "message": "You can refactor this block to avoid returns inside the match. It\u0027s generally considered bad practice to have return statements in nested blocks because they disturb call flow.\n\n```\nmatch state {\n  BtAvConnectionState::Connected \u003d\u003e {\n    info!(...);\n    self.notify_bluetooth_device_connected(addr);\n    self.a2dp_states.insert(addr, state);\n  },\n  BtAvConnectionState::Disconnected \u003d\u003e {\n    match self.a2dp_states.remove(\u0026addr) {\n      Some(_) \u003d\u003e self.notify_bluetooth_device_disconnected(addr),\n      None \u003d\u003e warn!(...)\n    }\n  },\n  _ \u003d\u003e self.a2dp_states.insert(addr, state)\n}\n```",
